			"Message": "build(Rest): Update compiled binary to latest source\n\nRebuild the Rest binary to incorporate recent source changes, including the path separator fix in the VS Code compatibility test and the documentation submodule update.\n\nThe binary reflects the current build state after the fixes to `tests/integration/vscode_compatibility.rs` and the `Documentation/Rust` submodule advancement.",
